<title>USA: Turner Corp to renovate Tenn. stadium.</title>
<headline>Turner Corp to renovate Tenn. stadium.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turner Corp said Thursday it was recently awarded a $24.7 million stadium renovation and expansion project at Middle Tennessee State University in Murfreesboro.</p>
<p>Turner will refurbish the west stadium grandstands and demolish the east grandstands. New grandstands will be erected on the north, south and east side of the facility.</p>
<p>The project includes building a new press box tower as well as adding new field lighting and other support facilities.</p>
<p>Demolition work began in January and the project is scheduled for completion in April 1998, Turner said.</p>
</text>
